inguish top-tier mastery.\n\nEvidence Details\nFaculty decision support — decisions do not automatically alter assessment questions.\nReview\nAccept\nDismiss\nDiscuss Analysis\n(0)\n\nDiscussion never changes the AI result or the official content; decisions are made through the normal approval actions.\n\nLoading discussion…\nStudent Performance\n\nHow students actually performed, from finalized faculty marks. Separate from assessment-quality analysis.\n\nStudent Performance\n\nAggregating finalized grades…"}}
